"private."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2080
msgid "Preset: Minimal"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2081
msgid ""
"Maximum privacy. Disable all extended data sharing including progress and "
"chapter info. Only your question and book metadata are sent."
