"notes. X-Ray does not send them: it only matches them locally, to offer them "
"on an entity page."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2139
msgid "Allow Notebook"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2142
msgid ""
"Send notebook entries to AI. Used by Connect with Notes and actions with "
