msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:3260
msgid ""
"How much searching AI Book Tools may do per question.\n"
"\n"
"Quick: up to 4 lookups in 2 rounds, fastest, for simple factual questions.\n"
"Standard: up to 8 lookups in 4 rounds, a good balance.\n"
"Thorough: up to 16 lookups in 6 rounds, with a larger passage budget; slower "
"and costlier, for questions that need evidence from many places in the book."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:3272
msgid "AI Book Tools: Read Short Texts Whole"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:3273
msgid ""
"On by default. When the readable text (up to your position while spoiler "
"protection is on) is short enough, the AI gets it in one piece instead of "
"searching it: about 64,000 characters at Quick and Standard effort, 128,000 "
"at Thorough (non-Latin scripts count two to three bytes per character). Off: "
"always search, whatever the length."
msgstr ""

